n required a renewed plan review because its description text had changed after the original review. The renewed review passed with one advisory, which was deferred because the completed empirical conclusion is supported by the recorded sources. The second close attempt reran completion verification and closed cuddlesome-amoral-oyster without force. Enrich drain gate checks during these operations took 21 to 26 milliseconds and did not account for the multi minute LLM calls.","timestamp":1787600798644183001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F24 assessment completed. The post import check belongs to rebar fsck in the current codebase because fsck reads event bytes and Git refs and is read-only by default. Rebar doctor currently checks dependency links, dirty tracker artifacts, locks, and mapping configuration. The canonical doctor epic remains an idea that proposes adding fsck as a future category. Hexametral-peppery-wasp explicitly preserved fsck as the store integrity command. The proposed F24 edit remains a one line checklist correction from validate to fsck, without a redundant dry-run flag. F24 remains deferred pending operator approval.","timestamp":1787600971137747001}],"created_at":1787599007504438001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f578-0abd-f8e4-4266","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Session log","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a9ce48d1-6b29-40ec-a941-87c257c07be1","88f37083-f92f-4ff3-82a5-88b354f02dd2","2d0d7426-5ad1-48c8-8de4-2c98015ced01","9aed219f-fd03-4949-b703-6298d2572a49","15da5b2b-ca7a-46